[066] indent=0 block=-
[067] indent=4 block=36ddbe27
      "1. "
      "Forecasting questions rely on information contained in the " {b}
[068] indent=4 block=36ddbe27
      "   "
      "context layer" {b}
      " (cross-validation runs, forecast model methodology "
[069] indent=4 block=36ddbe27
      "   "
      "documents), which is not deployed in the MT environment, and has "
[070] indent=4 block=36ddbe27
      "   "
      "not been invested in."
[071] indent=0 block=-
[072] indent=4 block=36ddbe27
      "▾ "
      "Example" {b}
[073] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "Question:" {b}
      " \"For ERCOT__DART__PROF__UNIVARIATE__DAYZER config "
[074] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "version 1.2, explain at a high level what PROF does and which "
[075] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "inputs it uses.”"
[076] indent=0 block=-
[077] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "Context needed:" {b}
      " documents like "
      "PROF: Probabilistic Regime " {href=https://app.notion.com/p/196dbe27599280fe821aef46de0dd9fb}
[078] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "Overlayed Forecasting " {href=https://app.notion.com/p/196dbe27599280fe821aef46de0dd9fb}
      " "
[079] indent=0 block=-
[080] indent=4 block=36cdbe27
      "[image]" {i fg=#9b9a97}
[081] indent=0 block=-
[082] indent=4 block=36ddbe27
      "1. "
      "Flawed experiment design" {b}
      " - questions in the dataset asked about "
[083] indent=4 block=36ddbe27
      "   "
      "models and information that MC Beta users would not be privy to"
[084] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "1. "
      "These questions were closer to how we would expect an internal "
[085] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "   "
      "scientist to use the chat. In that context, it did not perform "
[086] indent=6 block=36ddbe27
      "   "
      "well. "
[087] indent=0 block=-
