      "ERCOT's published DA LMP forecast" {b}
      " (e.g., from the "
[227] indent=18 block=36cdbe27
      "  "
      "ERCOT DAM or their public forecast products) doesn't"
[228] indent=18 block=36cdbe27
      "  "
