[229] indent=18 block=36cdbe27
      "• "
      "External vendor forecasts" {b}
      " — no vendor forecast EQRNs"
[230] indent=18 block=36cdbe27
      "  "
      "(e.g., Wood Mackenzie, Ascend, or similar) are "
[231] indent=18 block=36cdbe27
      "  "
      "registered in the context for this date."
